Package: libvte-2.91-dev
Version: @DEB_VTE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Terminal/VTE
Depends: libvte-2.91-gtk4-0 (= @DEB_VTE_V@), libgtk-4-dev, libglib2.0-dev
Description: Development files for the VTE terminal widget (GTK4)
 Development headers, the unversioned symlink, and the pkg-config file for the
 GTK4 (vte-2.91-gtk4) flavour of the VTE widget. (The GTK3 flavour is built only
 when vte is configured with -Dgtk3=true.)
